"note": "* Decoding fix needed for new IE Error Report\n\n```bash\n    Error Report : [Grouped IE]\n        Enterprise specific IE Type: 32774\n        IE Length: 52\n        Enterprise ID: Travelping GmbH (18681)\n        Error Message : FAR ID 0, no route to 0.0.0.0 in FIB index 1\n            Enterprise specific IE Type: 32775\n            IE Length: 46\n            Enterprise ID: Travelping GmbH (18681)\n            Error Message: FAR ID 0, no route to 0.0.0.0 in FIB index 1\n```\n* Also it looks first SE message is malformed in wireshark, please confirm\n* Fix needed for IE OHC in second SE message\n```bash\n            Outer Header Creation : \n                IE Type: Outer Header Creation (84)\n                IE Length: 10\n                Outer Header Creation Description: GTP-U/UDP/IPv4  (256)\n                TEID: 0x00000000\n                IPv4 Address: 0.0.0.0\n```",
